WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:06.600
MOTHER / MOTHER
谢天谢地——你保住了晚饭。现在去看看妹妹，好吗？
Thank goodness—you saved dinner. Now please go check on Younger Sister, okay?

00:08.200 --> 00:15.200
YOUNGER SISTER / YOUNGER SISTER
没有人帮我！机器人，我再也不相信你了！你根本不在乎我。
